# macOS / cloud-sync duplicate artifacts ("coder 2.md", "config 2.json").
# Five stale copies of the .claude/agents/ prompts were sitting untracked and
# unignored: `git add -A` would have committed them, and a harness globbing
# .claude/agents/*.md could load the stale copy instead of the symlinked
# current one.
